{{Quote | ''The cave is littered with crystals.''}}
[[File:BattlebgCrystalCavern.png|thumb]]

Crystal Cavern is one of the field effects present in Rejuvenation. It is classified as a Magical Field and can be found in [[Amethyst Cave]].

==Transitions From Other Fields==

* [[Cave]] will transform into this field if either Diamond Storm or Power Gem is used.
** ''The cave was littered with crystals!''
* [[Dark Crystal Cavern]] will transform into this field if harsh sunlight is active at the end of the turn, and will transform back when it isn't.
** ''The sun lit up the crystal cavern!''

==General Effects==

* Certain moves and abilities involve using a crystal type that cycles between Fire, Water, Grass, and Psychic, in that order.
** Every instance of damage calculation from moves using a crystal type advances the crystal type. All moves use the same crystal type counter.
* Rock-type moves increase in base power by 1.5x and gain a crystal type sub-typing.
** ''The crystals charged the attack!''
* Dragon-type moves increase in base power by 1.5x.
** ''The crystal energy strengthened the attack!''

==Abilities Affected==

* Mimicry changes the user's type to a crystal type.
* Prism Armor additionally boosts Defense and Special Defense by 33%.

==Moves Affected==

===Moves which receive an attack buff===

* Judgment, Multi-Attack, Prismatic Laser, Rock Climb, Strength → 1.5x boost, crystal type sub-typing.
** ''The crystals' light strengthened the attack!''
** ''The crystals strengthened the attack!''
* Ancient Power, Diamond Storm, Luster Purge, Power Gem, Rock Smash, Rock Tomb → 1.5x boost.
** ''The crystals' light strengthened the attack!''
** ''The crystals strengthened the attack!''
* Aurora Beam, Dazzling Gleam, Doom Desire, Flash Cannon, Menacing Moonraze Maelstrom, Mirror Beam, Mirror Shot, Moongeist Beam, Photon Geyser, Signal Beam, Techno Blast → 1.3x boost.
** ''The crystals' light strengthened the attack!''

===Other moves===

* Aurora Veil can be activated regardless of weather. 
* Rock Polish additionally boosts the user's Attack and Special Attack by 1 stage.
* Stealth Rock instead deals crystal type-scaling damage.
** ''[Pokémon] was hurt by the crystalized stealth rocks!''

===Field-dependent moves===

* Camouflage changes the user's type to a crystal type.
* Nature Power becomes Power Gem.
* Secret Power may inflict a random status between Burn, Freeze, Sleep, or Confusion.
* Shelter halves damage from Dragon-type moves.
* Terrain Pulse's type becomes a crystal type.

==Transitions to Other Fields==

'''Any move in this section inherently gains a 1.3x damage boost if it changes the field, unless noted otherwise.'''

* This field will transform into this [[Dark Crystal Cavern]] if any of the moves Dark Pulse, Dark Void, Light That Burns the Sky, or Night Daze is used.
** ''The crystal's light was warped by the darkness!''
** ''The crystals' light was consumed!''
* This field will transform into [[Cave]] if any of the moves Bulldoze, Earthquake, Fissure, or Magnitude are used 2 times, or Tectonic Rage is used 1 time.
** ''The crystals are starting to crack...''
** ''The crystals were broken up!''
** As of v13.5.6, the field effect manual does not mention Fissure as a move that changes the field to [[Cave]].

==Items==

* [[Magical Seed]] boosts Special Attack and applies Magic Coat to the user.

